case-*.bin, properties.bin, width.bin, single-*.bin, decode-*.bin,
encode-*.bin, gb18030-patches.bin, kana.txt and entities.txt are generated observations from
PHP 8.5.12. See the generator programs in examples/. PHP 8.5
uses Unicode 17.0; these files do not use the newer tables in php-src main.

rare.bin is the little-endian binary representation of rare_cp_bitvec.h from
PHP's ext/mbstring. Copyright The PHP Group and Contributors; see PHP-LICENSE.
Source: https://github.com/php/php-src/blob/PHP-8.5/ext/mbstring/rare_cp_bitvec.h

The php86/ case, property and width files come from PHP 8.6.0RC7, which
uses Unicode 18.0. Single-byte and CJK encoding tables are shared.
